    "title": "West Newbury Veteran Firefighters Plan Saturday Hand Tub Muster - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHAV News Staff ,\n1 hours ago The West Newbury Veteran Firefighters Association is having its first Hand Tub Muster in decades this Saturday. The Muster is a sporting competition between towns to see who can pump water the farthest from a hand tub, an antique fire engine operated by human power. Hand Tub Musters have been held in New England for more than 175 years. Read full article",
